!Name: p90sidelwss-3
!C A period 90 c/3 puffer that produces a sideways LWSS (and an optional
!C glider if the last edge-spark spaceship is removed).  This works by
!C hitting a p90 spacehip with gliders from a p90 forwards rake.  The rake
!C can be replaced by individual incoming gliders to form a triggerable
!C LWSS and glider puffer.
!C David I. Bell, June 1996
!Source: jslife-moving
!
